/page/Currency\" title=\"Currency\">Platinum Piece</a></span></span>&#160;\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Weight\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\">0.10 lbs\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Location\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\"><b><a href=\"/page/The_Crucible\" title=\"The Crucible\">The Crucible</a></b>, Underwater Chest (Epic Elite)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Enchantments\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Underwater_Action\" title=\"Underwater Action\">Underwater Action</a> <span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Underwater_Action\" title=\"Underwater Action\">Underwater Action</a>:</b> This item grants the wearer the ability to breathe water as if it were air.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Swim\" title=\"Swim\">Swim +20</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Swim\" title=\"Swim\">Swim +20</a>:</b> Passive: +20 <a href=\"/page/Competence_bonus\" title=\"Competence bonus\">Competence bonus</a> to the <a href=\"/page/Swim\" title=\"Swim\">Swim</a> skill.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Cold_Resistance\" title=\"Cold Resistance\">Cold Resistance +50</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Cold_Resistance\" title=\"Cold Resistance\">Cold Resistance +50</a>:</b> Passive: +50 <a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">Enhancement bonus</a> to your Cold Resistance.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Swim_like_a_Fish\" title=\"Swim like a Fish\">Swim like a Fish</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Swim_like_a_Fish\" title=\"Swim like a Fish\">Swim like a Fish</a>:</b> While this item is equipped and you are swimming, you gain the <a href=\"/page/Evasion\" title=\"Evasion\">Evasion</a> feat. Evasion causes you to take no damage on a successful Reflex saving throw against an effect which would normally allow half damage on a successful <a href=\"/page/Reflex_save\" title=\"Reflex save\">Reflex save</a>.</span></span></li>\n<li><style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r705465\">.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment.orange>span.title,.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment>span.popup.tooltip>a[href*=\"Orange\"]{background-color:#F4A460;border-color:#0B5B9F}.mw-parser-output span.pop